<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0481a450351e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3967] From 2012 till 2018, she was the Director of Product Design at Mark Zuckerberg-led company Facebook." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3967" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/08b97be6bcbc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3966] He quickly reports back that the woman running their social media used a cropped square image from their website." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3966" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0f8dd9b09801> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "@elizlaraki X post, Oct 15, 2024, 2:12 PM" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3966" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/17eca4fa8472> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3968] Elizabeth Lazarki, who has previously worked with Google Maps, Facebook and YouTube, shared the edited photo on X." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3968" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/284eee063caf> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3969] Elizabeth Laraki is set to attend a conference on UX and AI later this year and the organisers put up an ad for the same." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3969" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2a5f3515d0d8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3968] Elizabeth Lazarki, who has previously worked with Google Maps, Facebook and YouTube, shared that she was attending a conference later this year on UX and AI design." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3968" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/352e3564201a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3967] Luckily, I know the hosts for @upscaleconf. They are great people. When I called this out, they found the issue, apologized + fixed it quickly." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3967" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/40f1a8b54a31> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[7007] Elizabeth Laraki, a former employee at Google who worked on Google Maps, was distraught upon first glance at an ad for the AI conference (Upscale Conf), where she is a panelist." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7007" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/40f2c17bda72> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3969] She needed it to be more vertical, so she used an AI expand image tool to make the photo taller." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3969" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4769d5c8d48a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3966] He quickly reports back that the woman running their social media used a cropped square image from their website." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3966" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6232a1e605fa> a airo:Evidence ;
